Local (Wi-Fi) prefers the charger's own HTTP API and falls back to the cloud; Cloud only (4G) always uses the cloud.

Manual IP addresses in use: {manual_ips}

Tick the box below to enter or change a fixed IP address for each charger — needed when the V2C cloud is unreachable or reports the wrong address. Clear it to remove every manual address and let the cloud supply them again.
